962	 *
963	 * Split by who authored each event, because that split is the whole point of
964	 * the export: what the house did on its own (`system`) has to stay separable
965	 * from what the manager handed over (`player`) and what the workers did with
966	 * it. Every number here is counted, never estimated, and nothing is
967	 * attributed to a model that did not stamp the event itself.
